WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:06.606 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des bagages bandonnés,

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:07.841 size:53% position:73% line:53%
orphelins; on les compte

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:09.042 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par centaine à l'aéroport

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.277 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Trudeau.

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.478 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une valise bleue! Bleue!

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Alexandra Bergeron est revenue

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.914 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de vacances mercredi dernier.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:15.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Six jours plus tard, il lui

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:16.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
manque toujours une valise.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:17.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On appelle Air Canada,

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.819 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on n'a aucune réponse,

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:20.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
personne nous dit trop quoi

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:21.221 size:53% position:73% line:53%
faire. C'est l'enfer,er,er,

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.756 size:53% position:73% line:53%
honnêtement. Fait que là,

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:24.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on cherche à travers les valises

00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:25.792 size:53% position:73% line:53%
empilées de tout le monde.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:27.294 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ils ont tout perdu.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:28.829 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Toutes les valises ici,

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:30.330 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ils ont juste envoyé les valises

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:31.865 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sans les personnes, c'était

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:33.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
épouventable... Very bad.

00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:34.868 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vous, vous avez eu

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:36.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la chance parce que vous avez

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
recupéré vos deux valises?

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:39.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai prié un peu, puis j'ai

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:40.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
trouvé les deux autres sacs.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:42.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce passager, arrivé

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:43.977 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Tel Aviv vendredi dernier,

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:45.512 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vient tout juste de retrouver

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.013 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sa valise.

00:00:44.311 --> 00:00:48.548 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Je pensais jamais la retrouver,

00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:50.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je ne m'attendais pas à la

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:51.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
trouver comme ça,

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:53.120 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans un coin, empilée

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:55.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sous d'autres valises."

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:57.157 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Si vous pouvez venir ici,

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:59.159 size:53% position:73% line:53%
venez, n'attendez pas après

00:00:55.455 --> 00:01:01.194 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les compagnies aériennes."

00:00:57.491 --> 00:01:03.196 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'industrie touristique qui

00:00:59.493 --> 00:01:05.198 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reprend ses activités à vitesse

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:07.234 size:53% position:73% line:53%
grand V avec la fin des mesures

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:08.735 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sanitaires est frappée

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:10.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de plein fouet par une pénurie

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:11.771 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de personnel.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:13.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La situation a créé un effet

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:14.808 size:53% position:73% line:53%
domino sur les différents

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
services

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.844 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Air Canada, par exemple,

00:01:15.142 --> 00:01:19.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
transporte quotidiennement plus

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:23.917 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 120 000 clients,

00:01:18.345 --> 00:01:25.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ivement à 23 000

00:01:19.713 --> 00:01:26.319 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il y a un an.

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:27.554 size:53% position:73% line:53%
agnie ajoute avoir

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:28.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des problèmes avec son système

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:31.224 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de gestion des bagages,

00:01:27.888 --> 00:01:32.425 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce qui force l'annulation

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:33.660 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de certains vols etdes probdes .

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:34.861 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 S'ajoute à la situation

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:37.297 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le manque d'effectifs

00:01:33.994 --> 00:01:38.331 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux activités frontalières;

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:39.366 size:53% position:73% line:53%
jusqu'à 3000 agentssupplémentait

00:01:37.631 --> 00:01:40.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
disponibles.

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:41.401 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MARC WEBER, président, syndicat

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.436 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des douanes et de l'immigration

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.637 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je ne comprends pas comment la

00:01:41.735 --> 00:01:44.871 size:53% position:73% line:53%
situation maintenant n'était

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.073 size:53% position:73% line:53%
100% prévisible.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.307 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 -Ottawa promet d'intervenir.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:48.508 size:53% position:73% line:53%
OMAR ALGHABRA,

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:49.743 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre des Transports

00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:51.745 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"De notre côté, tout a été fait.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:53.780 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il faut maintenant collaborer

00:01:50.077 --> 00:01:55.782 size:53% position:73% line:53%
davantage avec les compagnies

00:01:52.079 --> 00:01:57.817 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aériennes et les aéroports pour

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:59.319 size:53% position:73% line:53%
trouver on aux retards

00:01:56.116 --> 00:02:00.520 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des vols et la problématique

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:01.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des bagages. Nous avons besoin

00:01:59.653 --> 00:02:02.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de leur collaboration, affirme

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:04.191 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le ministre des Transports."

00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:05.425 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pour l'instant, les voyageurs

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:08.895 size:53% position:73% line:53%
doivent s'armer de patience.

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:08.895 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 ICI Marie-Michelle Lauzon,

00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:08.895 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Montréal.

